        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Maybe a quick feedback after using jump2d for a couple of days. I am often in the situation, where i need to jump 3-4 times to get to the location, where I want, while with hop it usually takes two jumps. I have a feeling that this happens when I want to jump to a location that is not so far away.",
